m_assets/steam/apps/2828590/extras/dd22d038953810c9796745683ad92f99.mp4?t=1761669247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828590/extras/4232599edfaccabf951555cd17b298af.avif?t=1761669247\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the Inexplicable </strong>— There’s something off in the Cunningham House. A strange energy crackles in the air. Maybe it’s something harmless. Maybe it’s not. Joni must confront otherworldly forces and use them to her advantage before they can be used against her.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel the Mystery</strong> — What truly haunts Joni Evers? Is it the force that occupies the mansion? Or have the regrets and sorrows of the past somehow taken shape and life of their own? Perhaps both? Find out the truth as you delve deeper into the past, exploring Joni’s memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828590/extras/958a28f521f89d2ef68aff2e38021932.poster.avif?t=1761669247\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828590/extras/958a28f521f89d2ef68aff2e38021932.webm?t=1761669247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828590/extras/958a28f521f89d2ef68aff2e38021932.mp4?t=1761669247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience a Personal Story</strong> — Joni and her family have fractured, but is the damage b